# v9 Architecture (canonical)

Import from v9 packages only. Root legacy shims and duplicate trees are removed.

**Three top-level units** (phase-arch split): `engine/` = shared kernel (main bot), `bot/` = main bot, `hunt/` = **standalone** hunter (`hunt_core`). Dependency: `engine ← bot` only; `hunt` does **not** import `engine.*` or `bot.*`; `engine` never imports `bot.*`/`hunt`.

| Package | Role | Import example |
|---|---|---|
| `engine/domain/` | Config, schemas, contracts (shared) | `from engine.domain.config import load_settings` |
| `engine/market/` | REST, WS, universe, enrichments (shared) | `from engine.market.data import BinanceFuturesMarketData` |
| `engine/features/` | Polars pipeline + pivots (shared) | `from engine.features.prepare import prepare_symbol` |
| `engine/` leaves | `errors`, `coercion`, `secrets`, `data_readiness`, `telegram`, `contract`, `telemetry` | `from engine.errors import DEFENSIVE_EXC` |
| `bot/runtime/` | Bot loop, analyzers, handlers, scheduler | `from bot.runtime.bot import SignalBot` |
| `bot/policy/` | Bot-side domain policies: `mtf`, `catalog_guards`, `labels`, `delivery_policy` | `from bot.policy.catalog_guards import ...` |
| `bot/persistence/` | Tracking, outcomes, diary | `from bot.persistence import SignalTracker` |
| `bot/engine/` | Strategy registry + executor | `from bot.engine import SignalEngine, StrategyRegistry` |
| `bot/strategies/` | 38 setup detectors (single tree) | `from bot.strategies import ...` |
| `bot/setups/` | Shared SMC, `spec_runtime`, utils — **not** duplicate detectors | `from bot.setups.spec_runtime import SpecDetectorSetup` |
| `bot/delivery/` | Contract pipeline, confluence, orchestrator | `from bot.delivery import deliver` |
| `hunt/hunt_core/` | Hunter package — CCXT market plane, watch loop, Telegram | `from hunt_core.market.factory import create_hunt_market_plane` (see `hunt/docs/CCXT.md`) |

## Phase order (complete for structure)

1. **Phase 1–2** ✅ — scaffold + de-bloat + `features/` / `delivery/` packages
2. **Phase 3** — slim analyzer (partial)
3. **Phase 4** — strategy calibration waves (ops)

